sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as Customer
  participant R as ROLLER
  participant P as PATCH
  participant API as Loyalty App API
  participant DB as App Database
  participant VIEW as Website or PWA
  participant EXT as External Events (CRUD)

  U->>R: Buy park pass
  opt External create source
    EXT->>R: Create booking event
  end
  R->>P: Automation sync: Send purchase data for loyalty update
  P-->>API: POST /webhooks/patch/contact-updated
  API->>DB: Save loyalty snapshot

  P->>P: Stamp logic: Count all tickets in booking (large orders included)
  alt Loyalty target reached
    P->>P: Reward logic: Generate one or more unique one-time codes
    P->>P: Contact save: Append codes to contact code array
    P->>R: Code sync: Register codes for checkout validation
    P-->>API: POST /webhooks/patch/reward-code
    API->>DB: Save available code list
  end

  U->>VIEW: Open loyalty view
  VIEW->>API: GET /account
  API->>DB: Read loyalty and code state
  API-->>VIEW: Return loyalty status and code list
  VIEW-->>U: Show loyalty progress and available codes

  U->>R: Use a free-pass code at checkout
  R->>R: Validate code is active and unused
  R->>R: Invalidate code after successful use
  R-->>U: Apply discount

  loop Scheduled verification automation
    P->>R: Query checkout data for code usage (ROLLER Data API)
    R-->>P: Return usage status for checked codes
    P-->>API: POST /webhooks/patch/contact-updated
    API->>DB: Add used codes to invalidation list
  end

  alt External booking is edited or canceled
    EXT->>R: Update or delete booking event
    R->>P: Automation sync: Send booking change
    P-->>API: POST /webhooks/patch/contact-updated
    API->>DB: Save corrected loyalty and code state
  end

  alt Webhook processing fails
    API->>DB: Log failed webhook only (no retry)
  end

  U->>VIEW: Refresh loyalty view
  VIEW->>API: GET /account
  API->>DB: Read latest snapshot
  API-->>VIEW: Return updated loyalty and code status
  VIEW-->>U: Show latest status
